# Force consistent LF line endings for all text files, regardless of a
# contributor's OS or local core.autocrlf setting, and independent of
# GitHub Actions runner defaults. This repository's CI (validate.yml)
# regenerates dataset/*.csv and diffs the result against what's
# committed; if line endings depended on ambient git config instead of
# being pinned here, that check could fail on pure whitespace noise
# rather than a real content difference.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Rendered raster images are binary — never run text normalization or
# line-ending diffs against them.
*.png binary
